66
00:03:56.736 --> 00:04:01.139
L’espace, la frontière finale.

67
00:04:01.173 --> 00:04:04.939
Ce sont les voyages de l’Entreprise Starship.

68
00:04:05.044 --> 00:04:06.944
Sa mission continue -

69
00:04:07.046 --> 00:04:10.948
Découvrir de nouveaux mondes étranges

70
00:04:11.017 --> 00:04:15.454
